<view class="container">
  <view class="mode-switch card">
    <view
      class="mode-btn {{mode === 'requirement' ? 'mode-btn-active' : ''}}"
      data-mode="requirement"
      bindtap="onModeChange"
    >我需求人（发需求）</view>
    <view
      class="mode-btn {{mode === 'service' ? 'mode-btn-active' : ''}}"
      data-mode="service"
      bindtap="onModeChange"
    >我提供服务（挂牌）</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{categories}}" range-key="label" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="onCategoryChange">
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">类目</text>
        <text class="form-value">{{categories[categoryIndex].label}} ▾</text>
      </view>
    </picker>

    <view class="form-row">
      <text class="form-label">标题</text>
      <input class="form-input" placeholder="如：求换 8/28 夜班" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitleInput" maxlength="30" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-row" wx:if="{{mode === 'requirement'}}">
      <text class="form-label">时段</text>
      <input class="form-input" placeholder="如：8/28 18:00-次日8:00" value="{{schedule}}" bindinput="onScheduleInput" maxlength="40" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-row">
      <text class="form-label">酬金</text>
      <input class="form-input" type="digit" placeholder="元（选填，线下结清）" value="{{fee}}" bindinput="onFeeInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-col">
      <text class="form-label">说明</text>
      <textarea class="form-textarea" placeholder="补充科室、要求等。病例内容请务必脱敏，禁止出现患者可识别信息" value="{{detail}}" bindinput="onDetailInput" maxlength="500" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="compliance text-hint">
    · 酬金由双方线下直接结清，平台不代收代付
    · 换班需遵守所在医院相关规定，平台仅提供信息撮合
    · 病例相关内容禁止患者隐私信息
  </view>

  <button class="btn-primary submit-btn" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
    {{submitting ? '发布中…' : '发布'}}
  </button>
</view>
